[en.DECISION_C04_RETURN_TO_WEATHER_FACTORY]
Return Home

[en.DECISION_C04_RETURN_TO_WEATHER_FACTORY_desc]
As the Timbucktu Crystal Industry switching from rapid growth stage to a stable stage, Miss Laurette proposed to Wind Rider to let the workponies from the Weather Factory return to their home and stop the separation between them and their families.

[zh.DECISION_C04_RETURN_TO_WEATHER_FACTORY]
归乡

[zh.DECISION_C04_RETURN_TO_WEATHER_FACTORY_desc]
随着廷马克图水晶行业从快速增长逐步进入稳定阶段，劳雷特向乘风提议让那些来自天气工厂的工马们返回家乡，避免与他们的家庭分隔两地。
